      "id": "claim_5c5630b9dc9249979a009dcc8ee62f69",
      "statement": "The store must provide a conditional create, a conditional overwrite, and read-after-write consistency; S3, R2, Tigris, GCS, and Azure Blob qualify, while Backblaze B2, Hetzner, and DigitalOcean Spaces do not.",
